WEBVTT

00:05:57.676 --> 00:06:01.636
Well, I think it's fair to say
the consensus is on the left. Interesting.

00:06:01.676 --> 00:06:06.876
OK. Now instead of being in a wheelchair,
you're using a walking frame,

00:06:06.916 --> 00:06:08.196
so you can walk,

00:06:08.196 --> 00:06:10.756
but you need to have both
of your hands on the frame.

00:06:10.796 --> 00:06:14.556
Which set of doors do you think
you would be likely to use now?

00:06:14.596 --> 00:06:17.316
Could you raise your hands
if you're able to?

00:06:17.316 --> 00:06:19.436
I'm really surprised.
Everyone's going left.

00:06:19.436 --> 00:06:21.876
OK. Right.

00:06:21.916 --> 00:06:25.956
Now you're pushing a child in a pushchair
so you can walk quite normally,

00:06:25.996 --> 00:06:29.636
but you've got a pushchair
and both of your hands on it.

00:06:29.676 --> 00:06:30.916
Which set of doors now?